#: ../../source/docs/common-herelink.rst:5 1791b6c5e7c14c569261ef7be9ba5913
msgid "Herelink RC/HD Video Transmission System"
msgstr "Herelink RC/高清视频传输系统"

#: ../../source/docs/common-herelink.rst:7 780702a5883a4838a1b402f3b5c68321
msgid ""
"Herelink is an integrated remote controller, ground station and wireless "
"digital transmission system which can be used with the Cube Autopilot and "
"Ardupilot. Herelink allows RC control, HD video and telemetry data to be "
"transmitted up to 20km between the ground station and air unit, the Herelink"
" remote controller features custom Solex TX and QGC applications and both "
"air unit and ground station feature an integrated 8 core SOC for custom "
"application development. Herelink 1.1 also includes Ethernet connectivity "
"from the air unit to gimbals,cameras, and autopilots in addition to HDMI, "
"SBUS and UART based I/O."
msgstr ""
"Herelink 是一套集成遥控器、地面站和无线数字传输系统，可与 Cube 飞控和 ArduPilot 配合使用。Herelink 支持 RC "
"控制、高清视频和数传数据在地面站与空中单元之间传输最远 20km，Herelink 遥控器具有定制化的 Solex TX 和 QGC "
"应用程序，空中单元和地面站均集成了 8 核 SOC，便于自定义应用开发。Herelink 1.1 在 HDMI、SBUS 和 UART "
"接口基础上，还增加了空中单元到云台、相机和飞控的以太网连接功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-herelink.rst:13 fc6862183c5f4937909aa7d84e0a7757
msgid "Features"
msgstr "功能特点"

#: ../../source/docs/common-herelink.rst:14 a3d5eb2a7bf645dab0d137b40749e00f
msgid ""
"Android based smart device with 5.46 inch 1080P capacitive touch screen."
msgstr "基于 Android 的智能设备，配备 5.46 英寸 1080P 电容触摸屏。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-herelink.rst:15 efae75c1b64d4c14bc58f05adc582a5a
msgid ""
"Integrated digital transmission system simultaneously transmitting video, "
"telemetry and control."
msgstr "集成数字传输系统，可同时传输视频、数传和控制信号。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-herelink.rst:16 6ad3d46a47664a4d91c8177a486033ae
msgid ""
"Custom Solex TX and QGC ground station software with MAVLink support for "
"ArduPilot and PX4."
msgstr "定制化 Solex TX 和 QGC 地面站软件，支持 ArduPilot 和 PX4 的 MAVLink。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-herelink.rst:17 638b2b72af80456f830b7ededde3759d
msgid "Dual hall effect self centering gimbals with removable sticks."
msgstr "双霍尔效应自动回中云台，配备可拆卸摇杆。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-herelink.rst:18 4f07c0cb5a204c348f9318f4aecd430e
msgid "1080P HD video with dual digital video inputs."
msgstr "1080P 高清视频，双路数字视频输入。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-herelink.rst:19 3285107212744be29a3662f86eebccda
msgid ""
"Dual S.bus signal output for simultaneous control of autopilot and pan/tilt "
"cameras."
msgstr "双路 S.bus 信号输出，可同时控制飞控和云台/倾斜相机。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-herelink.rst:20 6e609d29e3534d19a1100313759a5a02
msgid "6 customizable MAVLink buttons and Mavlink/Sbus hardware wheel."
msgstr "6 个可自定义的 MAVLink 按钮和 MAVLink/SBUS 硬件拨轮。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-herelink.rst:21 ac7933a4e2e64054bf4eabeb7c606852
msgid ""
"RC gimbal control on dedicated service independent from Solex TX / QGC."
msgstr "独立于 Solex TX / QGC 的专用服务 RC 云台控制。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-herelink.rst:22 595cb193cf334bc3bca5a7fe1074292f
msgid ""
"Tether and share video and telemetry via wifi ground station such as Mission"
" Planner."
msgstr "通过 WiFi 地面站（如 Mission Planner）共享视频和数传数据。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-herelink.rst:23 79cc16f6310644da8652c2e7b1f6aa2e
msgid ""
"Onboard Arm Cortex A53 & Cortex A53 SOC in both air and ground units for "
"custom applications."
msgstr "空中单元和地面单元均内置 Arm Cortex A53 & Cortex A53 SOC，用于自定义应用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-herelink.rst:26 5b40d118b4be44f5b52dbdc107cb772d
msgid ""
"`Herelink System Overview <https://docs.cubepilot.org/user-"
"guides/herelink/herelink-overview>`__"
msgstr ""
"`Herelink 系统概览 <https://docs.cubepilot.org/user-guides/herelink/herelink-"
"overview>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/common-herelink.rst:28 27cca6ace31748e194a2e0d2239aefbd
msgid ""
"`Herelink User Manual <https://docs.cubepilot.org/user-"
"guides/herelink/herelink-user-guides>`__"
msgstr ""
"`Herelink 用户手册 <https://docs.cubepilot.org/user-guides/herelink/herelink-"
"user-guides>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/common-herelink.rst:31 054fb86d33474100ad7bac7049b42b00
msgid "Ethernet Connectivity"
msgstr "以太网连接"

#: ../../source/docs/common-herelink.rst:33 67e72de249ac4df1802e5c2dead0ad29
msgid ""
"Instead of using a UART serial connection to connect the autopilot to the "
"AirUnit, an Ethernet virtual serial connection may be used"
msgstr "除使用 UART 串行连接将飞控连接到空中单元外，也可使用以太网虚拟串行连接"

#: ../../source/docs/common-herelink.rst:35 1a9069eed13b4eb89d590f48750c4740
msgid ""
"An example of the setup of the Herelink in a networked ArduPilot vehicle "
"system is detailed in :ref:`common-ethernet-vehicle` but a short form of the"
" instructions is below"
msgstr ""
"在网络化 ArduPilot 飞行器系统中设置 Herelink 的示例详见 :ref:`common-ethernet-"
"vehicle`，以下为简短说明"

#: ../../source/docs/common-herelink.rst:40 efbe4bf2058b4e3e9db95786769c7de3
msgid ""
"Connect the AirUnit and autopilot using an :ref:`ethernet adapter <common-"
"ethernet-adapters>`.  The wiring for the AirUnit when used with a BotBlox "
"SwitchBox is shown above but CubePilot's CubeLAND 8-Port Switch can also be "
"used"
msgstr ""
"使用 :ref:`以太网适配器 <common-ethernet-adapters>` 连接空中单元和飞控。上图展示了与 BotBlox "
"SwitchBox 配合使用时空中单元的接线方式，也可使用 CubePilot 的 CubeLAND 8 端口交换机"

#: ../../source/docs/common-herelink.rst:41 c6cb892cadaa4017b889cb55e46b8f85
msgid ""
"Ensure the AirUnit and autopilot are on the same subnet (e.g the first 3 "
"octets of the IP address match, 4th octet is different)"
msgstr "确保空中单元和飞控位于同一子网（即 IP 地址的前 3 个字节相同，第 4 个字节不同）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-herelink.rst:43 43ab9b6bc7a84f48817a35132ed04431
msgid ""
"Herelink AirUnit's IP address is 192.168.144.10, GroundUnit's is "
"192.168.144.11"
msgstr "Herelink 空中单元的 IP 地址为 192.168.144.10，地面单元的 IP 地址为 192.168.144.11"

#: ../../source/docs/common-herelink.rst:44 089ebf19ce634070b9aa083c6bfc2814
msgid ""
"Set the autopilot's :ref:`NET_ENABLE<NET_ENABLE>` = 1 and reboot to enable "
"networking"
msgstr "把飞控的 :ref:`NET_ENABLE<NET_ENABLE>` 设为 1 并重启，启用网络功能"

#: ../../source/docs/common-herelink.rst:45 f95bc20acd664e738f8cfaded2c30e0d
msgid ""
"Set the autopilot's IP address using :ref:`NET_IPADDR0<NET_IPADDR0>`, "
":ref:`NET_IPADDR1<NET_IPADDR1>`, :ref:`NET_IPADDR2<NET_IPADDR2>`, "
":ref:`NET_IPADDR3<NET_IPADDR3>` (e.g. 192.168.144.14)"
msgstr ""
"用 "
":ref:`NET_IPADDR0<NET_IPADDR0>`、:ref:`NET_IPADDR1<NET_IPADDR1>`、:ref:`NET_IPADDR2<NET_IPADDR2>`、:ref:`NET_IPADDR3<NET_IPADDR3>`"
" 设置飞控的 IP 地址（如 192.168.144.14）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-herelink.rst:47 59b1d45b96ca460e95c17300b361937c
msgid "Create a serial connection over ethernet for MAVLink telemetry"
msgstr "通过以太网为 MAVLink 数传创建串行连接"

#: ../../source/docs/common-herelink.rst:49 72f074323eaf476bafb6f3e1ac4dd787
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`NET_P1_TYPE<NET_P1_TYPE>` = 1 (UDP Client) and reboot the "
"autopilot"
msgstr "设置 :ref:`NET_P1_TYPE<NET_P1_TYPE>` = 1（UDP 客户端）并重启飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-herelink.rst:50 1d8cc1ce40fc4015ae239586222c2594
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`NET_P1_IP0<NET_P1_IP0>`, :ref:`NET_P1_IP1<NET_P1_IP1>`, "
":ref:`NET_P1_IP2<NET_P1_IP2>`, :ref:`NET_P1_IP3<NET_P1_IP3>` to the Herelink"
" AirUnit's IP address (e.g. 192.168.144.11)"
msgstr ""
"将 "
":ref:`NET_P1_IP0<NET_P1_IP0>`、:ref:`NET_P1_IP1<NET_P1_IP1>`、:ref:`NET_P1_IP2<NET_P1_IP2>`、:ref:`NET_P1_IP3<NET_P1_IP3>`"
" 设置为 Herelink 空中单元的 IP 地址（例如 192.168.144.11）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-herelink.rst:51 66ef1a3306754da288f6f503c72631bd
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`NET_P1_PORT<NET_P1_PORT>` = 14550 (port that AirUnit listens on)"
msgstr "设置 :ref:`NET_P1_PORT<NET_P1_PORT>` = 14550（空中单元监听的端口）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-herelink.rst:52 c4d8b4069ac5457590ac3e193c249013
msgid "Set :ref:`NET_P1_PROTOCOL<NET_P1_PROTOCOL>` = 2 (MAVLink2)"
msgstr "设置 :ref:`NET_P1_PROTOCOL<NET_P1_PROTOCOL>` = 2（MAVLink2）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-herelink.rst:54 95e4e26e888343e28a0a7ed7b8b0f1a1
msgid ""
"For information on how to include a camera gimbal to the system, please see "
"the individual wiki pages for the :ref:`Siyi <common-siyi-zr10-gimbal>`, "
":ref:`Topotek <common-topotek-gimbal>` and :ref:`ViewPro <common-viewpro-"
"gimbal>` gimbals"
msgstr ""
"有关如何将相机云台集成到系统的信息，请参见 :ref:`Siyi <common-siyi-zr10-gimbal>`、:ref:`Topotek "
"<common-topotek-gimbal>` 和 :ref:`ViewPro <common-viewpro-gimbal>` 云台的各自 wiki"
" 页面"

#: ../../source/docs/common-herelink.rst:57 4c975909fc1d458dbc17ce98fa88d3e2
msgid "Updating QGC"
msgstr "更新 QGC"

#: ../../source/docs/common-herelink.rst:59 d3053a2185c34bbeb7bae7f89dda546b
msgid ""
"As of June 2024 the Herelink comes pre-installed with QGC-4.0.8.  If you "
"wish to upgrade to QGC-4.4 (or higher) which includes improved camera and "
"gimbal support follow these instructions:"
msgstr ""
"截至 2024 年 6 月，Herelink 预装了 QGC-4.0.8。如需升级到 "
"QGC-4.4（或更高版本，包含改进的相机和云台支持），请按以下说明操作："

#: ../../source/docs/common-herelink.rst:61 cff88f0a94b64707b04a22a049dbb5cf
msgid ""
"Open the `QGC releases page "
"<https://github.com/mavlink/qgroundcontrol/releases>`__"
msgstr "打开 `QGC 发布页面 <https://github.com/mavlink/qgroundcontrol/releases>`__"

